      "content": "That's really strong language. If I use that \"dignity and dependency\" angle, it should definitely land. \n\nJust to be sure I'm prepared, what would a Pro-UBI student say in response to that? I want to see if their counter-argument is actually strong enough to stand up against the points you just made.",
